{"title":"Career roadmap · Community Development Officer","role":"Community Development Officer","summary":"A Community Development Officer works with communities, NGOs, government programmes, local institutions and development partners to identify community needs, design interventions, mobilise participation, coordinate implementation and measure social outcomes.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Community Development Officer works with communities, NGOs, government programmes, local institutions and development partners to identify community needs, design interventions, mobilise participation, coordinate implementation and measure social outcomes."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA Sociology is highly aligned because it develops understanding of social structures, inequality, communities, institutions, culture, social change and field research. To become professionally effective, this foundation should be combined with community mobilisation, programme management, monitoring & evaluation, social research, data analysis and stakeholder coordination."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Sociology","Community Fieldwork","Development Programme Skills","NGO/Government Internship","Community Development Role","Programme Management"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Community Development Intern, Field Assistant"},{"text":"Community engagement"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Community Mobiliser, Community Development Associate"},{"text":"Field implementation"}],[{"text":"Early-Mid"},{"text":"Community Development Officer, Project Officer"},{"text":"Programme coordination"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Senior Community Development Officer, Program Manager"},{"text":"Program